and why do we need them?

5
00:00:13,256 --> 00:00:14,186
Data structures

6
00:00:14,875 --> 00:00:17,905
simply allow you to manage data. So data

7
00:00:17,905 --> 00:00:20,871
structures are the things in your code that

8
