11
00:00:30,489 --> 00:00:33,104
programming languages, would be arrays,

12
00:00:33,682 --> 00:00:36,861
objects, maps, sets, something like this.

13
00:00:37,856 --> 00:00:39,205
Now, just to make it clear what I'm talking

