00:01:05,162 --> 00:01:08,468
argue, you also have maps in JavaScript.

25
00:01:08,629 --> 00:01:10,988
I'll come back to those. And you have sets.

26
00:01:11,902 --> 00:01:15,112
These are the 4 big data structures, the 4

27
00:01:15,112 --> 00:01:18,017
